	<section_number>45.2-524</section_number>
	<catch_line> Examination fees</catch_line>
	<text>
		A reasonable fee in an amount set by the Board of Coal Mining Examiners, not to exceed $50, shall be paid to the Chief by each person examined before the commencement of the examination. Fees collected shall be deposited in the Coal Mining Examiners' Fund created by § 45.2-523.
	</text>
